---
import '../../styles/mate/header.css';
import Icon from '../other/Icon.astro';
---

<header class="mate-header-page">
  <div class="header-top-nav">
    <a href="/" class="back-link">
      <Icon name="arrow-left" /> Back to Home
    </a>
  </div>

  <div class="header-main-content">
    <div class="header-titles">
      <h1 class="page-title">Yerba Mate Reviews</h1>
      <p class="page-subtitle">
        From traditional gourd rituals to modern energy boosts.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="intro-cards">
      <div class="intro-card">
        <div class="intro-card-icon">
          <Icon name="compass" />
        </div>
        <div class="intro-card-content">
          <span class="intro-card-title">Discover</span>
          <span class="intro-card-text">Honest reviews you can trust</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="intro-card">
        <div class="intro-card-icon">
          <Icon name="mug-hot" />
        </div>
        <div class="intro-card-content">
          <span class="intro-card-title">Ritual</span>
          <span class="intro-card-text">The mate experience</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="intro-highlight">
    <div class="intro-highlight-icon">
      <Icon name="mug-hot" />
    </div>
    <div class="intro-highlight-content">
      <div class="intro-highlight-header">
        <span class="intro-highlight-title">Espíritu gaucho, libertad que te conecta</span>
      </div>
      <p class="intro-highlight-text">
        Welcome to my personal archive of Yerba Mate reviews. As a European who has fallen in love with the vibrant culture of Argentina 🇦🇷 and the unique ritual of drinking mate 🧉, I want to share my honest impressions with you. I am here to help you cut through all the options and find the mate that actually suits your taste, so you can just skip the guesswork and get straight to the good stuff.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p class="header-note">
    <Icon name="circle-info" />
    Note: As a non-smoker, I personally prefer unsmoked mate. Consequently, you will notice that smoked varieties receive lower ratings in my reviews.
  </p>
</header>
